✅ Pro Tip for CKA Exam

Always follow this troubleshooting order:

1️⃣ kubectl get
2️⃣ kubectl describe
3️⃣ kubectl logs
4️⃣ kubectl exec

This solves 80% of Kubernetes issues.

kubectl get pods -A
kubectl describe pod <pod>
kubectl logs <pod>
kubectl get events
kubectl get svc
kubectl get endpoints
kubectl get nodes
kubectl top nodes
kubectl auth can-i
